{"id":"H2144","lemma":"זֶ֫כֶר","transliteration":"zekher","sayIt":"ze-kher","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Zecher","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.8.31;\nson of: Abiel (H0022) and Maacah (H4601N);\nbrother of: Kish (H7027), Ner (H5369), Abdon (H5658J), Zur (H6698I), Baal (H1168B), Nadab (H5070J), Gedor (H1446I), Ahio (H0283I) and Mikloth (H4732); also called Zechariah at 1Ch.9.37;\nAlso named: ze.khar.yah (זְכַרְיָהוּ \"Zechariah\" H2148x)\n§ Zacher = \"remembrance\"\na Gibeonite","glosses":["zecher"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zecher","kjv":"and Zacher"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:31","note":"Gedor, Ahio, and Zecher.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H5369","lemma":"נֵר","transliteration":"ner","gloss":"Ner"},{"id":"H2148","lemma":"זְכַרְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zekharyah","gloss":"Zechariah"},{"id":"H0022","lemma":"אֲבִיאֵל","transliteration":"aviel","gloss":"Abiel"},{"id":"H0283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","transliteration":"achyo","gloss":"Ahio"},{"id":"H1168","lemma":"בַּעַל","transliteration":"baal","gloss":"Baal"},{"id":"H1446","lemma":"גְּדוֹר","transliteration":"gedor","gloss":"Gedor"},{"id":"H4601","lemma":"מַעֲכָה","transliteration":"maakhah","gloss":"Maacah"},{"id":"H7027","lemma":"קִישׁ","transliteration":"qish","gloss":"Kish"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}